# Facts about Mabel.

@fact mabel.teashop
tier: surface
text: Keeps the tea shop in the village: forty kinds of tea, three kinds of cake.

@fact mabel.door
tier: personal
hint: Open her door in a mood.
unlock: seen(mabel_intro) > 0
text: She reads your mood from the way you open her door, and is rarely wrong.

@fact mabel.tins
tier: personal
hint: Some students get tea on the barge.
unlock: seen(mabel_parcel) > 0
text: She sends tins of tea up to the castle on the barge for students she's worried about, and refuses payment for them.

@fact mabel.cups
tier: personal
hint: Ask about the cups behind her counter.
unlock: seen(mabel_cup) > 0
text: The cups on the hooks behind her counter belong to her regulars, living and dead. She remembers every one of them.

@fact mabel.petal
tier: surface
text: Calls everyone "petal", and means it more for some than others.

@fact mabel.fourth_cake
tier: personal
hint: Be brave about the cake.
unlock: seen(mabels_fourth_cake) > 0
text: Beside her three cakes there is sometimes a fourth, experimental and free, and she keeps a card on each: its name, the date, and the survivors.

@fact mabel.range
tier: personal
hint: Come in on a cold morning.
unlock: seen(mabels_cold_range) > 0
text: Her range goes out whenever the wind is in the north. Anyone who helps her light it is "staff, near enough", and carries the milk.
